# Doc ⋯ Menu

::summary
The unified doc overflow menu at FULL production-web parity (ruled 08-03 from the shipping surf.space menu) — an anchored rich menu, NOT a modal: `dropdown-select` is its vocabulary. Three sections: Actions (12 items, Move to trash = danger, always last), the General access selector (three options with descriptions, active option accent-filled with a checkmark), and AI (Generate with Surfy).
::

## Actions

::dropdown-select[name=doc-menu placement=anchored anchor=doc-menu-button action=runDocMenuAction]
- "Edit" value=edit icon=edit action=editDoc
- "Export as PDF" value=export-pdf icon=download action=exportDocPdf
- "Copy link" value=copy-link icon=copy action=copyDocLink
- "Share link" value=share-link icon=share action=openShare
- "Send in message" value=send-message icon=knowledge action=sendDocInMessage
- "Move to Workspace" value=move icon=move action=openMoveToWorkspace
- "Copy to Workspace" value=copy icon=copy action=openCopyToWorkspace
- "Rename" value=rename icon=edit action=openRename
- "Version history" value=versions icon=clock action=openVersionHistory
- "Download (.surf)" value=download icon=download action=downloadDocSurf
- "Archive" value=archive icon=archive action=archiveDoc
- "Move to trash" value=trash icon=trash style=danger action=trashDoc
::

## General access

Single-select group inside the same anchored menu, below the separator; the active option is accent-filled with a checkmark.

::dropdown-select[name=general-access label="General access" selected="Workspace" action=setDocAccess]
- "Restricted" value=restricted icon=lock description="Only you" action=setDocAccessRestricted
- "Workspace" value=workspace icon=members description="Anyone in your workspace" action=setDocAccessWorkspace
- "Anyone with link" value=link icon=share description="Signed-in users with the link + public web page" action=setDocAccessLink
::

## AI

::dropdown-select[name=doc-menu-ai label="AI" action=runDocMenuAction]
- "Generate with Surfy" value=generate icon=surfy-fin action=generateWithSurfy
::

Anchored to the detail bar's ⋯ button; scrim-click and Esc dismiss (an anchored menu carries no ✕ — it is not a sheet). Share link opens `modals/share.surf`; Move/Copy open `modals/move-copy.surf` with the matching title; Rename and Version history open their sheets; Move to trash is the danger item, always last in Actions.

At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the anchored menu goes edge-to-edge with 10px side insets and auto width; the wide anchoring is unchanged.
